ource srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This is a disambiguation page, which links to ambiguously named articles. If you were <a href=\"/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Jannath\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Jannath\">brought here</a> by a link in an article, consider editing it to direct towards the intended page instead.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Jannath</b> may refer to a prominent Patriar house of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>, as well as the individuals and items associated with its lineage.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Grand Duke Liia Jannath – A former ruler of the city mentioned in the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_6\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 6\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Book_Note_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grimlark_Verse_6\" title=\"Grimlark Verse 6\">Grimlark Verse 6</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Record_of_the_Honoured\" title=\"Record of the Honoured\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Record_of_the_Honoured\" title=\"Record of the Honoured\">Record of the Honoured</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fireliia_Jannath\" title=\"Fireliia Jannath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/30px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/45px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/60px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Fireliia Jannath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/30px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fireliia_Jannath\" title=\"Fireliia Jannath\">Lady Fireliia Jannath</a> – The current owner of <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li>\n<li>Lady Wisteria Jannath – Likely the mother of Lady Fireliia; mentioned in the text <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perfumed_Days,_Passionate_Nights\" title=\"Perfumed Days, Passionate Nights\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perfumed_Days,_Passionate_Nights\" title=\"Perfumed Days, Passionate Nights\">Perfumed Days, Passionate Nights</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raylen_Jannath\" title=\"Raylen Jannath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png/30px-Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png/45px-Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png/60px-Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lord Raylen Jannath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png/30px-Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Portrait_Raylen_Jannath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raylen_Jannath\" title=\"Raylen Jannath\">Lord Raylen Jannath</a> – A guest present for the coronation of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Jannath%27s_Bodyguard\" title=\"Lord Jannath's Bodyguard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Lord_Jannath%27s_Bodyguard.png/30px-Portrait_Lord_Jannath%27s_Bodyguard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Lord_Jannath%27s_Bodyguard.png/45px-Portrait_Lord_Jannath%27s_Bodyguard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Lord_Jannath%27s_Bodyguard.png/60px-Portrait_Lord_Jannath%27s_Bodyguard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lord Jannath's Bodyguard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Lord_Jannath%27s_B